            ("Korea K-ETA official notice · Extension of temporary exemption (23 December 2025)", "https://www.k-eta.go.kr/portal/board/viewboarddetail.do?bbsSn=299707&locale=EN", "English"),
            ("Korea e-Arrival Card official portal", "https://www.e-arrivalcard.go.kr/portal/main/index.do?locale=EN", "English"),
            ("Korea e-Arrival Card · Eligibility Navigator", "https://www.e-arrivalcard.go.kr/portal/guide/navigator.do?locale=EN", "English"),
